# Adro Cloud — Mosquitto ACL
# One block per site. Copy-paste to add a new site.

# ── Hub bridges (per-site, isolated) ─────────────────────
# Format:
#   user site-XXX
#   topic readwrite adro/site-XXX/#

# Example for site-kenaro:
# user site-kenaro
# topic readwrite adro/site-kenaro/#

# ── Operator / admin (full access) ───────────────────────
user adro-admin
topic readwrite #
